    "title": "FutureBit’s Apollo III Bitcoin Miner Hits Micro Center Shelves in Its First Brick-and-Mortar Launch",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/futurebit-apollo-iii-hits-micro-center-shelves",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/FutureBit-launches-Apollo-III-U.S.-Engineered-Home-Bitcoin-Miner.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/futurebit-apollo-iii-hits-micro-center-shelves\" rel=\"nofollow\">FutureBit&#8217;s Apollo III Bitcoin Miner Hits Micro Center Shelves in Its First Brick-and-Mortar Launch</a></p>\n<p>The Brooklyn company's compact home miner, rated at up to 18 TH/s and starting at $1,099.99, goes on sale Friday at four Micro Center stores, including the chain's new Austin location.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/futurebit-apollo-iii-hits-micro-center-shelves\" rel=\"nofollow\">FutureBit&#8217;s Apollo III Bitcoin Miner Hits Micro Center Shelves in Its First Brick-and-Mortar Launch</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
