    "title": "Robinhood’s Crypto Trading Volume Falls 48% in October as Event Contracts More Than Double",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/robinhood-crypto-volume-falls-48-percent",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Robinhood-Considers-Adding-Bitcoin-as-a-Reserve-Treasury-as-Crypto-Revenue-Surges.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/robinhood-crypto-volume-falls-48-percent\" rel=\"nofollow\">Robinhood&#8217;s Crypto Trading Volume Falls 48% in October as Event Contracts More Than Double</a></p>\n<p>Robinhood customers traded $17 billion of crypto in October, down 48% from a year earlier, while event contracts traded jumped 136% to 5.9 billion.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/robinhood-crypto-volume-falls-48-percent\" rel=\"nofollow\">Robinhood&#8217;s Crypto Trading Volume Falls 48% in October as Event Contracts More Than Double</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Robinhood-Considers-Adding-Bitcoin-as-a-Reserve-Treasury-as-Crypto-Revenue-Surges.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/robinhood-crypto-volume-falls-48-percent\" rel=\"nofollow\">Robinhood&#8217;s Crypto Trading Volume Falls 48% in October as Event Contracts More Than Double</a></p>\n<p>Robinhood customers traded $17 billion of crypto in October, down 48% from a year earlier, while event contracts traded jumped 136% to 5.9 billion.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/robinhood-crypto-volume-falls-48-percent\" rel=\"nofollow\">Robinhood&#8217;s Crypto Trading Volume Falls 48% in October as Event Contracts More Than Double</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
